---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const industries=[
  ['Manufacturing','Machine control, production lines, panel components and plant-floor connectivity.'],
  ['Oil and Gas','Instrumentation, electrical protection and control requirements for process environments.'],
  ['Energy and Utilities','Reliable switching, monitoring and automation layers for utility operations.'],
  ['Water and Wastewater','Pump control, measurement, telemetry and treatment process requirements.'],
  ['Infrastructure','Electrical distribution, facility systems and integrator-led project supply.'],
  ['Food and Beverage','Hygienic process environments, machine automation and traceable documentation.'],
  ['Chemicals and Process','Process measurement, control hardware and project engineering coordination.'],
  ['OEM and System Integration','BOM support, compatibility review and repeatable component sourcing.']
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Industries | Nubelon Technology" description="Industrial automation product and project requirements across manufacturing, energy, process and infrastructure applications.">
<header class="nav"><div class="wrap nav-inner"><a class="logo" href="/">NUBE<span>LON</span></a><nav class="nav-links"><a href="/products/">Products</a><a href="/services/">Services</a><a href="/brands/">Brands</a><a href="/industries/">Industries</a><a href="/solutions/">Solutions</a><a href="/resources/">Resources</a><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request a Quote</a></nav></div></header>
<main><section class="hero industries-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Industry pathways</div><h1>Industrial context<br/>matters.</h1><p>Start with the operating environment, then shape the control, power and measurement requirements around the project.</p><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Discuss your application ↗</a></div><img class="page-visual" src="/images/generated/nubelon-industries.webp" alt="Industrial power and process automation facility" fetchpriority="high" /></section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Application map</div><h2>From the plant<br/>to the project brief.</h2></div><p>These are working industry pathways for discovery. Specific references and project evidence will be added after approval.</p></div><div class="cards">{industries.map(([name,desc],i)=><article class="card"><span class="num">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>{name}</h3><p>{desc}</p><a href="/contact/">Discuss requirements →</a></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Middle East focus</div><h2>Built for clear<br/>technical conversations.</h2></div><p>For UAE, Saudi Arabia and wider regional enquiries, share the application, voltage, control platform, preferred brands and delivery destination. We will use that context to structure the next step.</p></div></section></main>
<footer><div class="wrap footer-row"><span>Nubelon Technology (Xiamen) Co., Ltd.</span><span>Industry pathways · draft scope</span><span>sales@nubeloncontrols.com</span></div></footer></BaseLayout>
<style>.nav-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;width:100%}.card a{display:inline-block;margin-top:24px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px;align-items:center}.split h2{font:600 clamp(32px,4vw,52px)/1 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:16px 0}.split p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}.industries-hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#0b1117}.page-visual{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:.42;mix-blend-mode:normal;z-index:0}.industries-hero:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(11,17,23,.96) 0%,rgba(11,17,23,.72) 48%,rgba(11,17,23,.28) 100%);z-index:1}.hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:2}@media(max-width:760px){.split{display:block}.split p{margin-top:28px}.page-visual{opacity:.28}.industries-hero:before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(11,17,23,.9),rgba(11,17,23,.5))}}</style>
